    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Jimmy the Sloth embarks on his own magical adventure. Think Lion Quest, but with a sloth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sloth Tales delights and inspires with the following features:</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mighty-fine and very free platforming adventure. Where you play as Jimmy the Sloth.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dash and high-jump powerups redefine play with new ways to explore.<br></li><li>A light amount of story \u2013 just enough to leave you wanting more!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open-ended design where the levels can be played through in any order. Plus a small amount of randomness ensures no two Sloth Tales are exactly the same.<br></li><li>Soundtrack is a brand-new song by the band Falcon Ave. \u2013 perhaps their catchiest one yet.</li></ul><br>\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013<br><br>Approx. playtime 30 mins (maybe 1hr if you take your time)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/04c2a604a8a96638076607fb9b0ea837.avif?t=1733824461\" /></div><br><br>Sloth Tales is a standalone adventure, but it's also part of the even-more amazing game Lion Quest Infinity, which is also available on Steam.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/2cb828307a5b5e10bcee3f98bcd9cb5d.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Jimmy the Sloth embarks on his own magical adventure. Think Lion Quest, but with a sloth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sloth Tales delights and inspires with the following features:</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/17f97ac76304fbadac9ffd05f088b7ff.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mighty-fine and very free platforming adventure. Where you play as Jimmy the Sloth.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/187123766e2c5b45a4c6260f0c0db4a8.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dash and high-jump powerups redefine play with new ways to explore.<br></li><li>A light amount of story \u2013 just enough to leave you wanting more!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.poster.avif?t=1733824461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.webm?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/de55148ec3dabd8a2267893052f7c211.mp4?t=1733824461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open-ended design where the levels can be played through in any order. Plus a small amount of randomness ensures no two Sloth Tales are exactly the same.<br></li><li>Soundtrack is a brand-new song by the band Falcon Ave. \u2013 perhaps their catchiest one yet.</li></ul><br>\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013<br><br>Approx. playtime 30 mins (maybe 1hr if you take your time)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435980/extras/04c2a604a8a96638076607fb9b0ea837.avif?t=1733824461\" /></div><br><br>Sloth Tales is a standalone adventure, but it's also part of the even-more amazing game Lion Quest Infinity, which is also available on Steam.",
